/**
 * "Manage" tab for a game server — a Pterodactyl/Nitrado-style control panel over
 * the customer's own game VM: game-service power, a live console (log tail + RCON
 * command box), connected-player list with kick/ban, world/save listing + backup,
 * and scheduled automatic restarts. Every action calls an ownership-guarded,
